Two details matter here: the augmentation counter stays fixed at 9,261 even for short runs, and the audit must reproduce model initialization before the loader draws its shuffle seed. The dataset’s six-item batch also has no query paths, so the audit needs a wrapper to carry them without changing the training dataset.

